WEBVTT

00:06:29.505 --> 00:06:30.740
because it's fun.

00:06:30.764 --> 00:06:34.149
(Laughter)

00:06:34.173 --> 00:06:37.040
Sports is to war as pornography is to sex.

00:06:37.064 --> 00:06:40.785
We get to exercise some ancient drives.

00:06:40.809 --> 00:06:42.824
The fourth foundation
is authority/respect.

00:06:42.848 --> 00:06:44.385
Here you see submissive gestures

00:06:44.409 --> 00:06:46.698
from two members
of very closely related species.

00:06:46.722 --> 00:06:50.437
But authority in humans is not so closely
based on power and brutality

00:06:50.461 --> 00:06:51.822
as it is in other primates.

00:06:51.846 --> 00:06:55.552
It's based on more voluntary deference
and even elements of love, at times.

00:06:56.211 --> 00:06:58.271
The fifth foundation is purity/sanctity.

00:06:58.295 --> 00:07:00.816
This painting is called
"The Allegory Of Chastity,"